  "question": {
    "text": "Following is the graph between <math> <mrow> <mi>log</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub> <mtext>t</mtext> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </msub> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mi>log</mi><mtext>a</mtext></mrow> </math> (<math> <mrow> <mtext>a</mtext><mo>=</mo></mrow> </math> initial concentration of reactant) for a given reaction at <math><msup><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. Hence, order of the reaction is<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0035_57b536911658.jpg\" style=\"width: 227px; height: 173px;\" /><br />\r(Here,&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>t</mtext> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow> </msub> </mrow> </math> is half-life)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mtext>0</mtext> </math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mtext>1</mtext></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mtext>2</mtext></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mtext>3</mtext></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>t</mtext> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </msub> <mo>∝</mo><msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mtext>a</mtext> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>n</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math> for nth order reaction.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>t</mtext> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mtext>k</mtext><msup> <mrow> <mfenced> <mtext>a</mtext> </mfenced></mrow> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>n</mtext></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mi>log</mi><msub> <mtext>t</mtext> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mfenced> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>n</mtext></mrow> </mfenced><mi>log</mi><mtext>a</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mtext>k</mtext></mrow> </math><br /><br />Thus, graph between <math> <mrow> <mi>log</mi><msub> <mtext>t</mtext> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </msub> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mi>log</mi><mtext>a</mtext></mrow> </math> is linear slope.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mfenced> <mrow> <mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>n</mtext></mrow> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><msup> <mrow> <mn>45</mn></mrow> <mtext>o</mtext></msup></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>"
  }
